      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process immediately before that process starts**. Specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- The key is injected only into the **environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process** (and similarly for the Query agent)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated and never holds the key\n- This design ensures that a compromised or misbehaving Hub process cannot leak the credential by inspecting its own environment variables\n\nThe key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API.",
